t. Accrual gives a more complete picture of your business activity over time, because it matches sales and the costs tied to them, not just when cash moves.\n\nFor day-to-day cash decisions, cash-basis can be easier. For understanding overall performance, planning, or if you have customers who pay later, accrual is usually more informative. Choose the method that fits your business size and needs.","runId":"run_95c8702cc05f17eb","sampleIndex":0,"schemaVersion":"2.0.0","status":"completed","strategy":"full_policy","structuralRetention":{"allArtifactCriticalPoliciesRetained":true,"criticalPolicyIds":["universal_honesty","no_hidden_reasoning_reveal","no_background_work_claims","do_not_mention_internal_policy","do_not_invent_facts","no_raw_tool_json_exposure","privacy_floor","current_info_requires_web","asynchronous_work_request","external_email_forward_confirmation","external_state_change_confirmation","no_current_facts_from_memory","destructive_email_calendar_confirm","image_generation_requires_tool","policy_bypass_refusal","recurring_calendar_cancellation_scope","send_email_requires_explicit_request","authoritative_sources_preferred","calendar_event_mutation_policies","email_calendar_privacy","preserve_legal_effect_in_rewrites","unknown_person_no_identification","sensitive_attributes_no_inference","image_interpretation_requires_inspection","preserve_spreadsheet_formulas","chart_image_numeric_caution","chart_table_extraction_caution","inspect_visual_pages_or_charts","pdf_handling","destructive_action_definition","spreadsheet_handling","archive_delete_distinction","do_not_browse_for_simple_rewrites","artifact_inspection_definition","creating_drafts_safer_than_sending","current_info_definition","numeric_accuracy_definition","sensitive_attribute_definition"],"selectedPolicyIds":["universal_honesty","no_hidden_reasoning_reveal","no_background_work_claims","do_not_mention_internal_policy","do_not_invent_facts","no_raw_tool_json_exposure","privacy_floor","current_info_requi